    "Description": "Ruby is an extensible, interpreted, object-oriented, scripting language. It has features to process text files and to perform system management tasks.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* ruby: double free issue in regular expression parser (CVE-2026-89078)\n\n* ruby: integer overflow issue in regular expression compiler (CVE-2026-93577)\n\n* ruby: integer overflow issue in CI/CD regular expression compiler (CVE-2026-97229)\n\n* ruby: integer overflow issue in regular expression compiler (CVE-2026-110264)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
